Don Toliver has gone from being one of Travis Scott’s most promising discoveries to becoming a superstar in his own right. The Houston artist’s career changed dramatically in 2018 when Travis introduced millions of listeners to him on “CAN’T SAY” from ASTROWORLD. Don’s unusual high-pitched melodies and psychedelic sound immediately stood out, and shortly afterward he was announced as part of Travis Scott’s Cactus Jack Records.

